# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database (Neon PostgreSQL — Serverless Postgres)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATABASE_URL        → Pooler endpoint (PgBouncer/transaction mode) for runtime
#                      queries. Used by Prisma Client at app runtime.
# DATABASE_DIRECT_URL → Direct (non-pooled) endpoint for Prisma Migrate, since
#                      migrations need a session-level connection that the pooler
#                      cannot provide. Derived by dropping the "-pooler" suffix.
# Both URLs enforce sslmode=require & channel_binding=require per Neon best practice.
# Note: NO double quotes — Bun's .env loader treats them literally (Prisma CLI
#       strips them, but Prisma Client runtime does not, causing URL validation
#       errors at runtime).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://neondb_owner:npg_RLakgGtKZo32@ep-rapid-star-av3i9hx7-pooler.c-11.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require&channel_binding=require&pgbouncer=true&connect_timeout=15
DATABASE_DIRECT_URL=postgresql://neondb_owner:npg_RLakgGtKZo32@ep-rapid-star-av3i9hx7.c-11.us-east-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require&channel_binding=require&connect_timeout=15

